# Agent scratch directories.
#
# These were kept out of the repository by .git/info/exclude, which is local to
# one clone and shared with nobody -- so the tree looked clean on the machine
# that had written the exclude and nowhere else. An ignore rule that is meant
# to hold for everyone belongs in the tracked file.
